---
import columnImg from "../assets/images/footer-column.png";
import logoGladson from "../assets/icons/logo-gladson-black-hd.png";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";

const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();

const navItems = [
  { label: "Início", href: "/" },
  { label: "Áreas de atuação", href: "/areas-de-atuacao" },
  { label: "Sobre", href: "/sobre" },
  { label: "Contato", href: "/contato" },
  { label: "Privacidade", href: "/politica-de-privacidade" },
];
---

<section class="closing" id="contato" aria-labelledby="closing-title">
  <h2 id="closing-title" class="sr-only">
    Entre em contato com Gladson Conceição
  </h2>

  <div class="container closing-inner">
    <div class="closing-top">
      <div class="closing-heading">
        <img src={logoGladson.src} alt="" width="220" height="146" />

        <div>
          <p>
            Orientação jurídica em
            <span> inventários, planejamento sucessório </span> e demais questões
            patrimoniais, com atendimento em
            <span> Sergipe </span> e em <span>todo o Brasil</span>.
          </p>
          <p>
            <span>Entre em contato</span> para esclarecer sua situação e entender
            os <span>caminhos jurídicos possíveis</span> para o seu caso.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="closing-contact">
        <div class="contact-list">
          <a href="tel:+5579988697480">
            <span>Telefone</span>
            <strong>(79) 98869-7480</strong>
          </a>

          <a href="mailto:gladsonconceicao_santos@hotmail.com">
            <span>E-mail</span>
            <strong>gladsonconceicao_santos@hotmail.com</strong>
          </a>

          <a
            href="https://www.instagram.com/gladsonconceicao/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            <span>Instagram</span>
            <strong>@gladsonconceicao</strong>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="closing-visual container" aria-hidden="true">
    <Image
      src={columnImg}
      alt=""
      aria-hidden="true"
      width={340}
      quality={80}
      format="webp"
      loading="lazy"
    />
  </div>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      <nav aria-label="Navegação do rodapé">
        {navItems.map((item) => <a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>)}
      </nav>

      <div class="footer-bottom">
        <span>
          © {currentYear}
          <strong> Gladson Conceição dos Santos</strong>. Todos os direitos
          reservados.
        </span>

        <span
          >Desenvolvido por <a
            href="https://melodigital.com.br/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Adriano Melo</a
          >
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</section>

<style>
  .closing {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;

    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: var(--color-background);
  }

  .closing-inner {
    position: relative;
  }

  .closing-top {
    padding-top: 40px;
    padding-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .closing-heading {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .closing-heading img {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    height: auto;
    opacity: 80%;
    filter: brightness(0) invert(1);
  }

  .closing-heading > div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    max-width: 590px;
  }

  .closing-heading > div > p {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .closing-heading > div > p > span {
    opacity: 50%;
  }

  .closing-contact {
    padding-top: 40px;
  }

  .contact-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .contact-list a {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 300;
    padding-bottom: 10px;

    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(246, 241, 232, 0.15);
  }

  .contact-list span {
    color: rgba(246, 241, 232, 0.45);
  }

  .contact-list strong {
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .closing-visual {
    position: relative;
  }

  .closing-visual :global(img) {
    position: absolute;
    width: 340px;
    height: auto;
    opacity: 0.15;

    right: 280px;
    top: -190px;
  }

  .footer {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .footer nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .footer nav a {
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(246, 241, 232, 0.5);
  }

  .footer nav a:hover {
    color: rgba(246, 241, 232, 1);
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 32px;

    padding-block: 16px;

    font-size: 11px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(246, 241, 232, 0.1);
  }

  .footer-bottom span {
    color: rgba(246, 241, 232, 0.35);
  }

  .footer-bottom span strong,
  .footer-bottom span a {
    color: rgba(246, 241, 232, 0.8);

    font-weight: 300;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .closing-heading {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .closing-heading img {
      width: 160px;
    }

    .closing-heading > div {
      max-width: 680px;
    }

    .closing-visual :global(img) {
      right: 40px;
    }

    .footer nav {
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .closing-top {
      padding-top: 32px;
      padding-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .closing-heading {
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .closing-heading img {
      width: 120px;
    }

    .closing-heading > div > p {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .closing-contact {
      padding-top: 32px;
    }

    .contact-list a {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .contact-list strong {
      max-width: 100%;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .closing-visual :global(img) {
      width: 240px;
      right: -40px;
      top: -120px;
    }

    .footer nav {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px 24px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }
  }
</style>
